        "cooked": "<p>So <a href=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/Cgp4oJdXEAA0ihj.jpg:large\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">this</a>&nbsp;just appeared.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Harpy 26</p><p>Arcane Blast</p><p>Power: &nbsp;The Harpy deals a target ? Infernal damage.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Magical Bequest (Request?)</p><p>Ongoing, Limited</p><p>Increase non-Projectile damage dealt by the Harpy by 1</p><p>Power: Flip one [?] control token. &nbsp;You may play an Ongoing card.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Huginn and Muninn 9</p><p>Avian Companions</p><p>At the start of your turn, you may destroy ? ongoing or environment card. &nbsp;If you do, flip one [?] control token.</p><p>When there are more [?] then [?] control tokens, increase projectile damage dealt by The Harpy by ?</p><p>At the end of your turn, this card deals ? target ? projectile damage.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Mainstay 28</p><p>Beatdown</p><p>Power: &nbsp;Mainstal deals 1 target 1 Melee damage, then deals 1 target 1 Melee damage.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Void Belter</p><p>Equipment, Relic, Limited</p><p>When this card is destroyed, Mainstay deals ? target 1 Projectile and 1 Fire damage.</p><p>Power: &nbsp;Mainstay deals ? target ? melee damage. You may destroy one of your cards.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Sweet ????</p><p>Equipment, Limited</p><p>(Can't read text)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span>Can't read any of La Comodora's cards, but she starts a 29 health.</span></p>",
