        "created_at": "2016-04-22T20:15:57.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I think I managed to read that last card of Mainstay's</p><p>Sweet Rhonda (Maybe Phonda)</p><p>Equipment Limited</p><p>At the start of your turn, you may draw a card.</p><p>At the end of your turn, you may discard a card. If you do, you may play a card.</p><p>When this card is destroyed, you may draw two cards.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Looks like Mainstay's gimmick must be breaking his own stuff to get cool effects to trigger...I like it</p>",
